WEBVTT

00:31.114 --> 00:33.950
THE TRUNK

00:35.869 --> 00:37.537
SORRY, I'M GOING TO BE LATE
I'LL BE THERE SOON

00:37.620 --> 00:40.331
Hurry before I run off in this dress
to some other guy.

00:48.423 --> 00:49.257
I love you.

00:52.802 --> 00:54.429
31,306 VIEWS

00:57.223 --> 01:01.061
PLEASE HELP ME STOP MY DAUGHTER
FROM FALLING FOR A MARRIAGE SCAM

01:08.318 --> 01:09.778
SB ELECTRONICS MANAGER SEO'S SEX TAPE

01:17.577 --> 01:20.163
ONE DAY, MY DAUGHTER BROUGHT HOME
A MAN SHE SAID SHE WANTED TO MARRY

01:20.246 --> 01:22.290
HE'S BISEXUAL AND TOOK PART
IN ALL KINDS OF LEWD ACTS

01:22.373 --> 01:23.541
HE'S SCAMMING MY DAUGHTER

01:25.335 --> 01:28.171
FIVE YEARS AGO,
TEN DAYS BEFORE THE WEDDING

01:30.423 --> 01:32.217
SEO DO-HA

04:29.560 --> 04:31.729
You canceled three days
before the wedding.

04:32.939 --> 04:36.234
For cancellations made
three to five days before the wedding,

04:36.317 --> 04:38.194
we can only offer a 30% refund.

04:38.278 --> 04:41.447
It can take up to two weeks
for the transaction to be canceled.

04:43.157 --> 04:44.826
We just need your signature here.

05:10.643 --> 05:11.853
Excuse me?

05:12.645 --> 05:14.397
Did you happen to drop this?

05:19.986 --> 05:21.571
Yes, it was you.

05:22.071 --> 05:23.781
You forgot it in the restroom,

05:23.865 --> 05:25.450
so I picked it up.

05:31.414 --> 05:32.582
I was throwing it away.

05:32.665 --> 05:33.958
Keep it.

05:34.625 --> 05:35.752
Or just throw it away.

05:37.420 --> 05:40.423
It looks like a wedding ring.
Why did you end things?

05:45.011 --> 05:46.262
Let me rephrase that.

05:46.346 --> 05:49.515
How did you end up falling for
a bisexual person, Ms. Noh In-ji?

06:01.486 --> 06:04.489
My name is Lee Seon.
I'm the COO of this establishment.

06:06.532 --> 06:07.700
I'm also the CEO of NM.

06:11.329 --> 06:13.831
First, the 70% penalty cancellation fee.

06:15.291 --> 06:19.295
Now, a dissection of an engagement
that was called off three days ago?

06:20.463 --> 06:21.881
You want me to fill out a survey?

06:23.591 --> 06:26.219
As the CEO of NM,
I'd like to make you a proposal.

06:27.470 --> 06:30.932
We're searching for employees
who can enter contract marriages.

06:32.016 --> 06:34.060
They'll be assigned to different posts
every year,

06:34.560 --> 06:36.521
and given executive-level salaries

06:36.604 --> 06:38.898
that include bonus pay
and comprehensive insurance.

06:39.524 --> 06:40.483
How does that sound?

06:42.693 --> 06:44.821
Contract… what?

06:46.906 --> 06:49.117
What's all the fuss over marriage anyway?

06:50.243 --> 06:51.202
Perhaps, Ms. Noh In-ji,

06:51.702 --> 06:55.331
you're the one to blame
for wanting an extravagant ceremony.

06:56.833 --> 07:00.837
Perhaps none of this would have happened
if you had just kept to yourselves.

07:02.839 --> 07:04.715
Did the social recognition

07:05.466 --> 07:06.926
matter that much to you,

07:07.677 --> 07:08.678
Ms. Noh In-ji?

07:18.146 --> 07:20.022
You don't know
the first fucking thing about me.

07:21.774 --> 07:23.025
A professional marriage.

07:24.152 --> 07:27.572
It may be the solution
to the downsides of modern-day marriage.

07:31.909 --> 07:34.036
Think of it as revenge, if you will.

07:39.333 --> 07:45.256
THE TRUNK

07:47.216 --> 07:48.843
We'll head straight to the ER.

07:49.886 --> 07:52.513
We'll be there in ten, no, five minutes.

07:53.431 --> 07:54.265
Okay.

08:18.873 --> 08:21.667
I'm going to give you a shot now.
You'll feel a slight prick.

09:01.332 --> 09:02.291
Han Jeong-won.

09:09.173 --> 09:11.968
What brings you here?
Are you here to see your father?

09:13.094 --> 09:14.178
I'm here for something else.

09:14.262 --> 09:15.972
Since you're here, you might as well…

09:17.056 --> 09:20.226
This is a hotel-grade hospital
with a medical team on 24-hour standby.

09:21.185 --> 09:22.436
I don't need to see him.

09:23.896 --> 09:25.022
But still…

09:25.773 --> 09:27.066
Call me once he's passed.

09:27.733 --> 09:29.443
I'll handle the funeral arrangements.

09:38.786 --> 09:39.912
Ungrateful bastard.

09:42.623 --> 09:44.458
NM
NEW NOTIFICATION

09:47.920 --> 09:49.338
CODE BLACK: DISPATCH KEEPER?
NO

09:53.759 --> 09:55.928
I'll make sure it doesn't leave a scar.

09:57.930 --> 09:59.473
A little more to the side,

09:59.557 --> 10:02.059
and it would have fallen on your head,
not your arm.

10:02.602 --> 10:06.355
You could have died.
Some people aren't worth getting hurt for.

10:06.439 --> 10:07.607
You barely even know me!

10:09.025 --> 10:10.610
Is that in the manual too?

10:12.028 --> 10:14.530
Having a husband die
a week into the marriage

10:15.906 --> 10:18.075
doesn't reflect well
in performance reviews.

10:21.579 --> 10:25.458
If you want to thank me for saving you,
let's grab some burgers. I'm starving.

10:33.507 --> 10:34.967
Two cheeseburger combos, please.

10:35.051 --> 10:36.802
One with no tomatoes.

10:36.886 --> 10:39.013
Sure, coming right up.

10:51.609 --> 10:54.153
Here are your cheeseburgers. Enjoy.

10:55.071 --> 10:55.905
Thank you.

11:22.598 --> 11:23.641
Why aren't you eating?

11:24.725 --> 11:26.435
I'm actually a vegetarian.

11:32.441 --> 11:34.110
I forgot to ask for it without tomatoes.

11:40.282 --> 11:41.742
So you even know how to joke.

11:43.244 --> 11:45.663
- Do you not like tomatoes?
- Do you?

11:45.746 --> 11:46.580
No.

11:47.873 --> 11:50.209
Then let's leave tomatoes out
of any future salads.

12:48.350 --> 12:51.103
It's gotten worse.
We should put some ointment on it.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.656
Can I ask a question?

13:03.157 --> 13:03.991
Yes?

13:05.743 --> 13:08.621
- How many times have you been married?
- This is my fifth.

13:16.545 --> 13:19.924
Does being married
help you have a better life?

13:20.549 --> 13:23.552
Do you enjoy being married?
Enough to make it your profession?

13:23.636 --> 13:26.472
You said you only had one question.
It's my turn now.

13:30.684 --> 13:32.812
Why do you hate
the lights in the living room?

13:36.607 --> 13:39.109
Who told you I hate them?

13:39.693 --> 13:41.111
You made it obvious.

13:41.862 --> 13:43.781
You turn your back
to avoid looking at them.

13:47.618 --> 13:48.994
If you're done, we should go.

14:25.990 --> 14:27.658
I asked Mr. Kim to take care of it.

14:28.909 --> 14:31.662
I may have a preference for solitude,
but people still tend to me.

14:32.538 --> 14:33.789
Call them if you need them.

15:14.538 --> 15:15.664
You and your bitching!

16:01.961 --> 16:02.795
Let me.

16:03.295 --> 16:05.172
My hand slipped.

16:06.465 --> 16:09.009
I don't normally eat breakfast,
so don't make anything.

16:10.386 --> 16:11.762
I do eat breakfast, though.

16:11.845 --> 16:13.263
Then just order something.

16:15.766 --> 16:17.393
I don't want to have to worry about you.

16:20.813 --> 16:21.939
I'll be going out now.

16:22.564 --> 16:23.524
Where to?

16:24.566 --> 16:25.693
I have a meeting.

16:26.402 --> 16:29.154
You should have dinner at home.
I'll wait for you.

16:33.784 --> 16:34.910
Can I use your car?

16:35.953 --> 16:37.830
Use any of the cars in the garage.

16:46.964 --> 16:48.382
A meeting at this hour?

18:02.956 --> 18:04.666
So who's this woman you're marrying?

18:06.043 --> 18:07.711
Someone you don't know.

18:07.795 --> 18:10.464
There's no one I don't know.

18:11.048 --> 18:12.633
So tell me, who is it?

18:24.269 --> 18:25.604
Seo-yeon introduced her to me.

18:26.271 --> 18:27.815
Lee Seo-yeon set you up?

18:28.774 --> 18:30.275
And you actually agreed?

18:30.359 --> 18:32.820
She said she'd take me back
if I lasted a year.

18:35.489 --> 18:36.323
I see.

18:38.075 --> 18:40.452
You're just a couple of fucked up
peas in a pod, aren't you?

18:41.328 --> 18:44.081
How silly of me to try to understand
what goes on in your heads.

18:44.832 --> 18:47.584
But what's our newlywed husband doing here
at this hour?

18:48.335 --> 18:49.878
- It's awkward.
- What is?

18:50.379 --> 18:52.214
The woman was injured…

18:54.383 --> 18:55.217
because of me.

18:55.801 --> 18:58.095
My being there might make things uneasy.

18:58.178 --> 19:01.140
Hold up, you're already living together?

19:53.275 --> 19:54.776
I told you I didn't require assistance.

19:55.277 --> 19:59.531
There's a medical record now,
which somewhat complicates the process.

19:59.615 --> 20:00.532
Please understand.

20:03.619 --> 20:04.953
Was violence involved?

20:05.662 --> 20:06.496
No.

20:07.372 --> 20:09.708
Could the situation
have escalated to violence?

20:10.209 --> 20:11.043
No.

20:11.960 --> 20:14.463
Is there a possibility
of violence in the future?

20:17.549 --> 20:19.551
Please alert us
if a code situation arises.

20:19.635 --> 20:21.511
Keepers are always on standby nearby.

20:22.638 --> 20:23.472
I…

20:24.306 --> 20:25.140
Yes?

20:35.984 --> 20:36.860
It's nothing.

21:41.883 --> 21:43.593
It's not looking good.

21:44.094 --> 21:47.681
I'm seeing inflammation as well.
I think we should remove the IUD.

21:48.473 --> 21:50.225
And how about freezing your eggs?

21:51.018 --> 21:52.978
I'm good.
I don't plan on getting pregnant.

21:53.061 --> 21:55.022
But you might change your mind later on--

21:55.105 --> 21:56.315
I said no!

21:59.901 --> 22:02.487
Let's give it some time
and just replace the IUD.

22:04.573 --> 22:05.574
You didn't hear?

22:05.657 --> 22:08.118
Apparently, that woman
protected Mr. Han Jeong-won

22:08.201 --> 22:11.788
as those expensive living room lights
fell on his head.

22:12.873 --> 22:14.666
Is Jeong-won all right?

22:14.750 --> 22:17.294
He's fine, but that woman's arm…

22:18.045 --> 22:21.214
She had a cut this big,
so he rushed her to the ER that evening.

22:21.840 --> 22:24.301
I don't believe it.
All that from a fallen decoration?

22:24.384 --> 22:28.930
Sure, but isn't she amazing?
I couldn't have done the same.

22:29.931 --> 22:32.642
For her to do something like that?

22:33.352 --> 22:35.187
Maybe she really loves him or something.

22:37.272 --> 22:40.400
By the way, the next Heritage Lounge
meetup is on the 15th.

22:40.484 --> 22:43.236
They say there'll be a guest lecturer.
You'll be there, right?

22:44.446 --> 22:45.280
Right.

22:46.114 --> 22:46.948
Yes.

23:17.020 --> 23:18.188
I can't sleep.

23:20.690 --> 23:21.900
The woman bothers me.

23:23.777 --> 23:24.820
I need you.

23:45.590 --> 23:46.967
She was hurt because of me.

24:03.817 --> 24:04.985
She disturbs me.

24:28.467 --> 24:29.593
The woman bothers me.

24:31.720 --> 24:32.721
She makes me uneasy.

25:15.472 --> 25:16.848
You just left it like that?

25:26.858 --> 25:28.360
I'm fine. It's just a scratch.

25:32.113 --> 25:33.782
Let's just watch soccer together.

25:44.167 --> 25:45.418
What's your phone number?

25:46.211 --> 25:48.421
I never saved it, so I couldn't reach you.

25:48.505 --> 25:52.259
Had you saved it, would you have called
to tell me you were coming home late?

25:52.342 --> 25:53.218
Yes.

25:54.844 --> 25:58.306
I'd have said not to make anything for me.
Not that you'd have listened.

26:07.566 --> 26:08.400
Here.

26:18.326 --> 26:20.579
NOH IN-JI

26:28.587 --> 26:30.338
Why do you enjoy
marriages like this anyway?

26:31.506 --> 26:32.757
Answer me this time.

26:41.016 --> 26:42.225
I wanted revenge.

26:44.060 --> 26:45.812
When I started doing this, at least.

26:47.105 --> 26:49.816
I've since come to realize
I'm rather good at this job.

26:54.904 --> 26:56.364
Now you answer my question.

26:57.032 --> 26:58.992
Why do you hate those lights so much?

27:13.506 --> 27:14.674
My father attached…

27:17.719 --> 27:19.137
a camera to that chandelier…

27:21.556 --> 27:22.891
to keep an eye on my mother.

27:24.559 --> 27:28.104
My mother was skinny, but she was tough.

27:30.148 --> 27:31.107
Eventually, though,

27:32.192 --> 27:33.026
she lost her mind.

27:37.697 --> 27:39.032
My home was a living hell.

27:41.910 --> 27:45.288
My father didn't want gossip,
so he never brought her to a hospital.

27:47.957 --> 27:49.834
Later, her sleepwalking got so bad

27:51.378 --> 27:53.546
that I had to follow her around
every night.

27:55.340 --> 27:57.467
I was afraid she might kill someone.
Or herself.

28:14.484 --> 28:16.861
My father didn't beat me back then.

28:18.613 --> 28:21.199
I could have done something to stop it.

28:24.119 --> 28:25.036
But I didn't.

28:31.543 --> 28:35.130
That's why I hate those lights.

28:45.598 --> 28:47.434
Why are you telling me all this?

28:51.062 --> 28:52.856
You said you weren't trying to seduce me.

28:55.984 --> 28:58.069
You said it was okay for me to be myself.

28:59.487 --> 29:02.699
I've given it some thought
and decided none of it matters anyway.

29:04.033 --> 29:06.745
It's like telling secrets
to someone who doesn't exist.

29:09.164 --> 29:12.500
Company protocol dictates
you keep my secrets, no?

29:36.941 --> 29:37.984
It's jasmine tea.

29:39.694 --> 29:40.528
Have some before bed.

29:51.956 --> 29:52.999
It smells great.

30:02.050 --> 30:04.761
Once I finish this book,
let's go on a trip.

30:05.678 --> 30:06.554
Maybe, we'll see.

30:08.097 --> 30:10.558
Let's just go. I'll make it work.

30:13.770 --> 30:14.604
Let's just go.

30:17.023 --> 30:18.274
Later.

30:21.069 --> 30:21.903
Hey.

30:22.403 --> 30:24.656
- Answer me.
- Give me a second.

30:28.201 --> 30:29.035
Hello?

30:34.707 --> 30:35.542
Yes?

31:14.038 --> 31:16.833
WIFE

31:31.723 --> 31:32.557
Hello?

31:45.862 --> 31:46.988
Is…

31:48.740 --> 31:50.074
He just fell asleep.

31:50.909 --> 31:52.952
He hasn't slept in days.
I shouldn't wake him.

31:55.538 --> 31:56.748
Is it urgent?

32:02.337 --> 32:04.797
Jeong-won's father
took a turn for the worse,

32:06.424 --> 32:07.717
but he pulled through.

32:08.843 --> 32:10.470
Give me a second. I'll wake him.

32:11.095 --> 32:11.930
It's fine.

32:12.972 --> 32:15.183
There'd be little he could do here anyway.

32:16.851 --> 32:18.227
He's going to be all right.

32:19.395 --> 32:21.272
Just tell him that I called.

32:22.815 --> 32:23.650
Okay.

32:24.984 --> 32:25.985
I'll tell him.

32:27.320 --> 32:28.196
Has Jeong-won…

32:30.156 --> 32:31.491
taken a lot of meds?

32:35.328 --> 32:36.371
You said he fell asleep.

32:38.831 --> 32:39.666
No.

32:40.667 --> 32:42.001
He just fell asleep.

32:43.544 --> 32:44.420
Just fell asleep?

32:46.464 --> 32:47.298
I see.

32:52.095 --> 32:52.929
All right, then.

33:28.589 --> 33:31.551
- Hey, it's mine.
- No, it's mine.

33:31.634 --> 33:34.679
- Take turns. Give Hwan a go too.
- You already had a turn.

33:34.762 --> 33:37.765
- Take turns and keep it down, you two!
- But it's mine!

33:38.641 --> 33:40.685
I can barely handle the kids
in the morning as it is.

33:40.768 --> 33:43.271
Cut me some slack.
I really can't drive today.

33:43.980 --> 33:46.399
I'm going to throw up mid-ride
if I take a cab.

33:48.109 --> 33:50.737
What the fuck? That mothertrucker.

33:50.820 --> 33:53.072
- A truck?
- Where's the truck?

33:55.450 --> 33:56.367
Mind the children.

33:56.451 --> 34:00.079
Fucks like that won't learn their lesson
until they're six feet under.

34:00.163 --> 34:02.582
Please stop swearing.
I'm getting motion sickness.

34:02.665 --> 34:04.709
It's your own fault for getting hammered.

34:04.792 --> 34:05.626
Right.

34:06.586 --> 34:07.962
It's all my fault.

34:08.546 --> 34:11.174
We won't have enough money for the remodel
even with a loan.

34:11.257 --> 34:13.051
Maybe we should only fix half the house.

34:13.134 --> 34:16.888
Why don't you try asking
Mr. Han Jeong-won?

34:16.971 --> 34:18.473
What do you think he is, UNICEF?

34:18.973 --> 34:19.807
Then again,

34:20.933 --> 34:23.895
there's not much difference
between 90% to 5% and 90% to 4%.

34:24.687 --> 34:25.688
Okay, fine.

34:26.606 --> 34:28.483
I'll try to get a bigger loan
from the bank.

34:28.566 --> 34:32.570
I run a tiny record label
and earn just enough to get by,

34:33.279 --> 34:36.574
but having Han Jeong-won work for me
creates this strange illusion

34:37.075 --> 34:38.326
that I'm part of the elite.

34:39.202 --> 34:41.037
Honey, how about we move abroad?

34:41.704 --> 34:44.665
I don't think Jeong-won's
ever going to stop working for me.

34:49.712 --> 34:51.005
Keep it down!

35:38.886 --> 35:39.762
You're awake.

35:42.515 --> 35:45.351
Did I fall asleep on the sofa?

35:45.935 --> 35:47.895
I wasn't strong enough
to move you to the bed.

35:52.483 --> 35:54.110
We should go to the hospital.

35:57.280 --> 35:59.574
Not for me,
but for you, Mr. Han Jeong-won.

36:02.160 --> 36:04.287
It's a shame, really.
He was doing so well.

36:05.454 --> 36:07.373
It's a good thing your wife was here.

36:08.374 --> 36:09.834
I heard you were on Jeju Island?

36:11.836 --> 36:12.670
Yes.

36:15.214 --> 36:16.048
Okay then.

36:28.436 --> 36:30.563
You should have done us a favor
and died last night.

36:32.148 --> 36:33.441
Quietly, without anyone knowing.

36:43.075 --> 36:44.952
NO RECENT MISSED CALLS

36:47.079 --> 36:49.790
Has Jeong-won taken a lot of meds?

36:50.499 --> 36:51.709
You said he fell asleep.

36:52.919 --> 36:53.753
No.

36:54.879 --> 36:56.214
He just fell asleep.

37:44.178 --> 37:45.221
What are you doing?

37:45.304 --> 37:46.722
I'm considering helping you.

37:49.475 --> 37:52.144
I've heard it's not a crime
for married couples to turn a blind eye

37:52.228 --> 37:53.396
to each other's crimes.

37:56.857 --> 37:59.277
Yes, assuming you know a good attorney.

38:01.362 --> 38:03.030
That being said, I do know a guy.

38:06.158 --> 38:06.993
Then…

38:09.161 --> 38:10.329
how about some revenge?

38:16.377 --> 38:17.336
Thank you.

38:36.314 --> 38:37.398
Looks like we won.

38:38.733 --> 38:40.693
He's alive,
but can't enjoy great food like this.

38:47.074 --> 38:48.284
You do things like that often?

38:50.453 --> 38:51.454
What do you mean?

38:52.038 --> 38:53.748
What was that thing you left
by the pillow?

38:56.500 --> 38:58.252
I'm sure you've seen them
in period dramas.

38:59.420 --> 39:01.005
They're dolls you can stick pins into.

39:06.177 --> 39:07.970
That one's actually full of baby powder.

39:09.430 --> 39:13.017
Having one helped me sleep
through even the stormiest of nights.

39:20.066 --> 39:20.941
I slept well.

39:23.778 --> 39:26.530
For the first time in about six months,
thanks to you.

39:27.406 --> 39:29.116
I'm glad to hear that it worked.

39:41.837 --> 39:42.838
"Wife."

39:45.841 --> 39:47.510
That's how she's saved on your phone.

39:48.594 --> 39:49.970
Have you contacted her yet?

39:51.430 --> 39:53.307
I don't see how that's your business.

39:54.058 --> 39:56.769
- I'll do as I please.
- She asked me if you had taken meds.

40:03.859 --> 40:06.237
I don't think you'd do anything
she didn't like.

40:08.864 --> 40:10.116
And she never tried to stop you.

40:13.661 --> 40:15.663
I think she's the one
who suggested the drugs to you.

40:28.926 --> 40:32.096
Please keep an eye on the vinyl covers.
Make sure they go on nicely.

40:32.179 --> 40:34.640
- Sure.
- As for the curing process…

40:34.723 --> 40:36.934
- Mr. Oh, sir?
- Zip it. Don't say a thing.

40:48.320 --> 40:49.655
HAN JEONG-WON

41:00.499 --> 41:01.584
You finally answered.

41:03.169 --> 41:06.547
I'm sorry they got in touch with you
about my father yesterday.

41:06.630 --> 41:10.759
It's fine. He wasn't the best
father-in-law, but I owed him that much.

41:13.679 --> 41:15.764
- Want to get some tea?
- Maybe next time.

41:15.848 --> 41:17.016
I have to be somewhere.

41:19.185 --> 41:20.019
I see.

41:23.063 --> 41:26.609
- I'll bring the lights once they arrive.
- Make sure to charge a lot for them.

41:28.652 --> 41:29.778
You look well.

41:30.613 --> 41:33.741
I actually fell asleep without meds.
On the sofa, no less.

41:35.117 --> 41:36.827
It wouldn't be the first time.

41:40.581 --> 41:41.540
I should get going.

41:42.208 --> 41:43.042
Right.

41:59.517 --> 42:00.559
Damn it.

42:05.231 --> 42:07.525
Damn, I forget every single time.

42:10.694 --> 42:12.279
What's the password?

42:14.573 --> 42:16.283
For the love of…

42:17.076 --> 42:18.536
Ms. Do-dam!

42:20.329 --> 42:21.747
Sure, make yourself at home.

42:22.289 --> 42:25.459
Look who's talking, Ms. Do-dam.
That's my vending machine you're using.

42:26.043 --> 42:29.255
That's why I'm getting one for you too,
you cranky bitch.

42:30.798 --> 42:32.967
Looks like I've gone and done you a favor.

42:33.467 --> 42:35.803
Do you know how much cholesterol
is in these?

42:36.428 --> 42:38.055
Please don't drink them then.

42:38.556 --> 42:40.307
How can I resist ready-made coffee?

42:41.100 --> 42:41.934
I feel you.

42:43.102 --> 42:46.355
What are you even doing here this early?
Shouldn't you be working?

42:47.398 --> 42:49.650
I told you,
you're destined to just scrape by,

42:49.733 --> 42:51.235
even if you work your ass off.

42:52.027 --> 42:52.861
Jesus!

42:53.404 --> 42:55.864
Cut me some slack.
I have it tough enough already.

42:56.574 --> 42:58.409
I have enough problems on my mind.

42:59.034 --> 43:00.411
What kind of problems?

43:04.206 --> 43:05.291
Remember Eom Tae-seong?

43:05.916 --> 43:06.792
Who?

43:06.875 --> 43:09.211
That fucking asshole
who used to stalk In-ji.

43:09.295 --> 43:11.672
Word is, he's been released
from the mental hospital.

43:12.631 --> 43:15.467
There's no telling what he'll try next,
which is obviously a problem.

43:15.968 --> 43:18.929
Just report him.
That's why we pay all those taxes.

43:19.013 --> 43:20.472
We can't involve the cops!

43:20.556 --> 43:21.765
Why not?

43:22.516 --> 43:24.268
We just can't.

43:25.644 --> 43:29.440
Besides, they let stalkers off
with a slap on the wrist.

43:29.523 --> 43:31.525
A suspended sentence is hardly punishment.

43:34.862 --> 43:39.158
Why do you look out for In-ji so much
when you have your own problems?

43:41.660 --> 43:43.162
I'm okay with me dying,

43:43.662 --> 43:44.913
but I can't let In-ji die.

43:45.497 --> 43:47.833
Cut the crap. What are you, a saint?

43:48.751 --> 43:51.045
What the hell did that bastard do anyway?

43:52.379 --> 43:55.883
That fucker Eom Tae-seong
is the reason In-ji's life's gone to shit.

43:55.966 --> 43:58.010
If only you knew
what that bastard did to her…

44:00.054 --> 44:01.513
It's complicated, okay?

44:09.521 --> 44:11.190
Fucking hell.

44:13.317 --> 44:16.612
I'll find this bastard, no matter what,
and when I do, I'll kill him.

44:49.061 --> 44:52.356
It seems Eom Tae-seong's shown up.

45:01.240 --> 45:03.534
- Thanks.
- No problem, sir. Go right ahead.

45:48.704 --> 45:54.251
I thought right now would be perfect
to try this freshly brewed tea.

45:54.334 --> 45:56.754
I guess you were meant to try it,
Mrs. Lee.

45:58.630 --> 45:59.465
Right.

46:03.343 --> 46:05.721
How's Jeong-won doing?

46:08.056 --> 46:09.725
He seems to be doing well.

46:10.934 --> 46:13.061
That would explain that look on your face.

46:14.563 --> 46:16.982
I was the one
who arranged that marriage for him.

46:17.483 --> 46:20.527
That seems like a test to me.

46:21.069 --> 46:23.781
You want him all for yourself,
but he keeps eluding you.

46:23.864 --> 46:26.950
You want to control every fiber of him,
but you just can't.

46:33.540 --> 46:35.626
I'm not that twisted.

46:36.126 --> 46:39.129
Of course you're not, Mrs. Lee.

46:42.090 --> 46:45.093
Ma'am, the instructor
for our next gathering

46:45.177 --> 46:47.262
is here to introduce himself.

48:32.701 --> 48:33.827
Can I approach you?

48:35.871 --> 48:36.788
No.

48:37.706 --> 48:40.000
- Then why are you here?
- I came to see you.

48:41.168 --> 48:42.628
But I guess I shouldn't have.

48:58.477 --> 49:01.647
Just go away, please.
Leave. There's nothing to see here.

49:01.730 --> 49:02.689
Get them out of here.

49:02.773 --> 49:06.068
I'm sorry, but you can't be here.
Please leave. I'm sorry.

49:06.151 --> 49:07.069
Please go.

49:14.993 --> 49:16.453
Stop them from going in this way!

49:16.536 --> 49:18.497
Seems like the chest wound
was the killing blow.

49:19.831 --> 49:21.291
I wonder how many of them there are.

49:21.792 --> 49:22.668
How many what?

49:23.502 --> 49:24.544
Fish.

49:25.253 --> 49:27.214
I'm sure there's a lot. All kinds, too.

49:28.715 --> 49:31.426
Maybe it's because I quit smoking,
but man, I'm hungry.

49:32.552 --> 49:36.139
There's a loach soup place that way,
and an entrail soup place right…

49:43.772 --> 49:45.440
Not that way, sir. The other way.

49:55.784 --> 49:58.870
I actually fell asleep without meds.
On the sofa, no less.

50:01.873 --> 50:04.418
No. He just fell asleep.

50:12.718 --> 50:16.555
Mr. Kim, I'm stopping by.
Please notify everyone.

50:40.037 --> 50:42.998
I'm Lee Seo-yeon, Han Jeong-won's ex-wife.

50:43.790 --> 50:44.624
I see.

50:45.751 --> 50:46.752
I'm Noh In-ji.

50:53.633 --> 50:56.261
- Can we try it two keys higher?
- Two keys higher it is.

51:08.023 --> 51:11.818
Bro, why don't we call it a day
and you buy me a nice meal?

51:12.486 --> 51:13.320
What do you say?

51:13.987 --> 51:16.364
Next time. I don't think I can today.

51:17.074 --> 51:17.908
Why not?

51:20.285 --> 51:21.328
I'm eating at home.

51:31.421 --> 51:34.091
I'm so sorry. My hand keeps slipping.

51:35.509 --> 51:37.928
It's fine. I'll just go to the bathroom.

51:39.054 --> 51:39.930
Sure.

53:03.013 --> 53:04.806
NOH IN-JI

53:07.809 --> 53:09.311
NOH IN-JI

53:09.394 --> 53:10.979
DO YOU TRUST HER?

53:24.534 --> 53:27.412
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

53:28.038 --> 53:29.414
Please check the number…

53:36.880 --> 53:38.089
Do you trust her?

53:40.258 --> 53:41.218
What?

53:41.301 --> 53:42.135
That woman.

53:42.677 --> 53:44.387
The one Lee Seo-yeon set you up with.

53:46.014 --> 53:47.682
Do you think she'll be on your side?

53:48.975 --> 53:50.101
Watch yourself.

53:50.936 --> 53:52.270
Don't get stabbed in the back.

54:03.907 --> 54:07.410
So Ms. Noh In-ji
is the owner of the trunk?

54:09.412 --> 54:10.247
Yes.

54:11.081 --> 54:13.291
She carried it with her to every dispatch.

54:14.376 --> 54:15.210
Dispatch?

54:15.794 --> 54:16.628
Yes.

54:17.712 --> 54:18.588
Where did she work?

54:20.757 --> 54:24.135
I don't know the details.
I only know that she was dispatched often.

54:24.761 --> 54:28.014
How can you not know
where your best friend worked?

54:29.432 --> 54:32.811
Do you remember the leaked video
from the Blooming Hotel?

54:34.854 --> 54:37.315
It was her marriage that was ruined
by that video.

54:38.191 --> 54:39.859
She's never really opened up to me since.

54:46.074 --> 54:46.992
Is that so?

55:01.256 --> 55:05.844
I renovated the interior
when we moved into this house.

55:08.138 --> 55:10.098
I changed everything except those lights.

55:12.183 --> 55:14.477
I figured they suited the home nicely.

55:16.646 --> 55:20.108
But I feel bad now given what's happened.

55:20.608 --> 55:22.110
Please don't.

55:22.861 --> 55:24.195
It was just an accident.

55:26.823 --> 55:28.867
I ordered new lights from France.

55:31.036 --> 55:32.287
At Jeong-won's request.

55:35.123 --> 55:35.957
I see.

55:44.507 --> 55:46.217
Let's drop this pretense.

55:47.719 --> 55:49.095
I'm sure you have questions.

55:50.555 --> 55:52.015
You know who I am, don't you?

55:56.978 --> 55:58.146
Don't you recognize me?

56:09.449 --> 56:10.283
Of course I do.

56:13.244 --> 56:15.497
Lee Seo-yeon,
Architecture Department, senior year.

58:27.295 --> 58:30.590
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
